        <obo:IAO_0000115>The process in which an inorganic ion is transported across a membrane.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>inorganic ion membrane transport</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>transmembrane inorganic ion transport</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
